    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "B*A / JAPAN AIR LINES\nSAFETY INSTRUCTIONS\n774750\nMAN TAKE-OFF AND LANDING\nBAGGAGE\nPlace baggage in the overhead bins or under a seat.\nPlease stow baggage securely.\nFASTEN SEAT BELT TIGHT AND LOW Keep seat belt fastened whenever seated.\n*Lid\nTo fasten\nTo tighten\nTo unfasten\nSEAT POSITION\nSet seat back\nand table in\nupright position.\nNO SMOKING\n1*E.R0***\nRefrain from\nsmoking in\nrestrooms or\naisles.\n5799 BRACE POSITIONS\n*#*1#1t DO NOT REMOVE FROM AIRCRAFT",
